-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 11.5.93 (הסתדרות המורים) — שכר ותנאי עבודה של העובדים
-- המדורגים בדירוג עובדי הוראה: the wage agreement of the 1993–1995 round
-- between the teachers' employers — the State, the Centre of Local
-- Government for the local authorities, and the three large cities — and
-- הסתדרות המורים. Its period and cost (§§2–3); a one-time payment of 20% in
-- May 1993 (§4); "תוספת 1993", 10% of the combined salary from September
-- 1993 (§5); the school in-service supplement, 4% rising to 11.2% (§6), and
-- what the teachers give for it: a unit of 120 minutes of in-service
-- training and two preparation days (§7, annexes ב'–ד'); the erosion check
-- against the engineers (§8); academisation, study funds, principals,
-- in-service allowances, sick-day continuity and the southern rent
-- participation (§§9–14); the in-service and subject coordinators, the
-- mother-teacher, supervisors, the thesis allowance, clothing, five
-- committees and the teacher moved from grades 7–8 (§§15–25); budgetary
-- pensioners, the strike days and early retirement (§§26–28); the
-- in-service unit, overtime outside school, percentage allowances and the
-- book of working conditions (§§29–32); exhaustion, industrial peace and
-- the joint committee (§§33–35); and annex א', the ministers' letter of
-- 31.8.92.
--
-- WHO CITES IT: §4(י) of הסתדרות המורים's agreement of 8.9.98 settles the
-- claims of its §30, and the follow-up committee's decision 248/2013 pays
-- an ICT coordinator off the reform by the rules of a subject coordinator,
-- of which the corpus holds §19(א) here; both import this file. The takanon
-- names it as a source of §§1.13, 1.25, 1.26, 1.28, 3.1, 3.14, 3.18, 6.10,
-- 7.1, 7.6, 9, 11 and 14; §§3.14.3, 3.18 and 1.13 are held to it in
-- l4/tests/1993-05-11_histadrut-hamorim_wage-agreement-1993-tests.l4.
--
-- NOT THE OZ AGREEMENTS' "11.5.93": the Oz LaTmura agreements of 31.8.94,
-- 12.9.95 and 14.8.2011 (§39) cite a collective agreement of 11.5.93
-- "between the parties" — ארגון המורים's own, the twin of this one, whose
-- numbering this one shares and which the corpus does not hold. Those files
-- keep it `outside the corpus`. Its round's public-sector framework
-- agreements (§34(ג)) are not in the corpus either.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — שכר ותנאי עבודה של העובדים המדורגים בדירוג עובדי הוראה (הסתדרות המורים, 11.5.1993)`

DECLARE `1993 wage agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `set up the 1993 joint committee on the ministers' guidelines`
    `follow the 1993 in-service training at school`
    `give the two preparation days of 1993`
    `carry out the 1993 erosion check`
    `pay or set off the 1993 erosion supplement`
    `set up the 1993 erosion database`
    `deliver the half-yearly data to the 1993 erosion database`
    `agree a change in the 1993 erosion check's method`
    `set the criteria for the 1993 tuition refunds and hour grants`
    `convert in-service hour grants into tuition refunds, under 1993`
    `examine the study funds, under 1993`
    `contribute to a study fund above a full position, under 1993`
    `examine the principals' authority and pay, under 1993`
    `set the criteria for the 1993 intermediate allowances`
    `settle the sick-day continuity arrangements of 1993`
    `examine retroactive payments in the local authorities, under 1993`
    `decide which supervisors get the 1993 in-service supplement`
    `set the criteria for the 1993 subject-coordinator allowances`
    `propose a larger thesis-guidance allowance, under 1993`
    `examine the junior-high problems, under 1993`
    `examine primary education, under 1993`
    `examine the seminaries' and colleges' terms, under 1993`
    `deduct the 1993 budgetary-pension share`
    `set the dates of the ten school days added in 5754`
    `settle the rules of the 1993 early-retirement tracks`
    `set how the 1993 in-service unit is carried out and checked`
    `propose overtime pay for work with pupils outside school, under 1993`
    `propose changes to the percentage allowances, under 1993`
    `compile the book of teachers' working conditions, under 1993`
    `negotiate over wages and working conditions during the 1993 agreement`
    `strike or lock out over a matter the 1993 agreement settled`
    `negotiate the framework supplements of 1993–1995`
    `take organisational steps over the framework supplements of 1993–1995`
    `decide a dispute over the 1993 agreement`
    `put a 1993 dispute to an arbitrator`
    `plan the in-service training of a school`
    `approve a school's in-service plan`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law: number 7029/93, the day left blank; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The State and who represents it (the wages commissioner at the Treasury and the Ministry's Director-General); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The three large cities (Jerusalem, Tel Aviv-Jaffa, Haifa); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 הסתדרות המורים, its secretary-general and its delegation; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The union's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the parties negotiated, to realise those guidelines, a substantial advance in the teacher's standing, pay and conditions and in the quality of teaching.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

-- ¶3: made and signed on 11.5.93.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the 1993 wage agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 11 5 1993

-- ¶10: a recital — the government's guidelines, in the letter of the
-- Ministers of Education and of Finance of 31.8.92 (annex א'), on which
-- the agreement rests.
@ref akn:preamble/p10
`the ministers' letter of 1993's annex א' was written on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1992

-- ¶12: the teaching employees ("עובדי הוראה") are the employers' employees
-- in the teaching scale; the negotiation was over their pay and terms for
-- the agreement's period.
@ref akn:preamble/p12
DECLARE `1993 wage agreement teacher` HAS
    `in the teaching scale, for the 1993 agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by one of the 1993 agreement's employers` IS A BOOLEAN @desc the State, a local authority the Centre of Local Government signed for, or one of the three large cities

GIVEN t IS A `1993 wage agreement teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 wage agreement applies to` t IF
        t's `in the teaching scale, for the 1993 agreement`
    AND t's `employed by one of the 1993 agreement's employers`

§§ `1 המבוא והנספחים`

@ref akn:art_1
`the 1993 wage agreement's preamble and annexes are part of it` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תקופת ההסכם`

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 1993 wage agreement's period` d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1993)
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1995)

§§ `3 מסגרת העלות`

-- The whole cost for the agreement's period is 25% beyond the
-- cost-of-living and framework agreements the economy signs for it, the
-- 3.8% of §5(א) counted within it. F-hh-1993-b: "as set out in §4 below"
-- points to the one-time payment, which is not where the cost is set out;
-- read as the payments from §4 on (convention reading.consistent): the
-- three recurring rates on the combined salary — §5(א)'s 3.8%, §5(ב)'s 10%
-- and §6's final 11.2% — add up to the 25% exactly (asserted below).
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1
`the 1993 agreement's cost frame` MEANS 25%
`the part of the 1993 cost frame already paid from 1.9.92` MEANS 3.8%

`the cost frame §3 of 1993 points to §4 for` MEANS 4
`the 1993 section that sets the one-time payment` MEANS 4

-- F-hh-1993-b's evidence: the section §3 points to is the one-time
-- payment's, and the recurring rates make up the frame.
`§3 of 1993 points to the one-time payment and the recurring rates make up the frame` MEANS
        `the cost frame §3 of 1993 points to §4 for` EQUALS `the 1993 section that sets the one-time payment`
    AND `the part of the 1993 cost frame already paid from 1.9.92` PLUS `the 1993 supplement rate` PLUS `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995)
            EQUALS `the 1993 agreement's cost frame`
#ASSERT `§3 of 1993 points to the one-time payment and the recurring rates make up the frame`

§§ `4 תשלום חד פעמי`

-- (א): a one-time payment of 20% of the gross salary, added to the salary
-- of May 1993. (ב): the gross salary here is the combined salary with the
-- framework-agreement supplements and the percentage supplements.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_b
`the 1993 one-time payment rate` MEANS 20%

GIVEN `combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `framework-agreement supplements` IS A NUMBER, `percentage supplements` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the gross salary for the 1993 one-time payment` `combined salary` `framework-agreement supplements` `percentage supplements` IS
    `combined salary` PLUS `framework-agreement supplements` PLUS `percentage supplements`

-- (ג): one who began work with the employers no later than 1.1.93 gets
-- all of it; (ד): one who began after 1.1.93 and up to 31.5.93 gets it in
-- proportion to his period of work — the part of the window the sentence
-- names, 1.1.93–31.5.93, that he worked, counted in calendar days
-- (convention dates.calendar); one who began after 31.5.93 is not named and
-- gets none.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_d
GIVEN `began work on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the 1993 one-time payment for one who began on` `began work on` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `began work on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1993) THEN 1
        IF `began work on` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 1993)
            THEN (DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 1993) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `began work on` PLUS 1)
                 DIVIDED BY (DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 1993) MINUS DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1993) PLUS 1)
        OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN `began work on` IS A DATE, `gross salary of May 1993` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 one-time payment` `began work on` `gross salary of May 1993` IS
    `the 1993 one-time payment rate` TIMES `gross salary of May 1993`
        TIMES `the share of the 1993 one-time payment for one who began on` `began work on`

§§ `5 תשלומים שוטפים ומועדיהם — "תוספת 1993"`

-- (א): the 3.8% paid to the teachers since 1.9.92, already in their salary
-- table, is counted in this agreement's cost (§3).
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5__para_a
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 3.8% counted in the 1993 cost is in the table on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1992)

-- (ב): from the salary of September 1993, a supplement of 10% of the
-- combined salary, "תוספת 1993".
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
`the 1993 supplement rate` MEANS 10%

GIVEN m IS A DATE @desc the salary month
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 supplement rate on` m IS
    IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) THEN `the 1993 supplement rate` ELSE 0

GIVEN m IS A DATE, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 supplement` m `combined salary` IS
    `the 1993 supplement rate on` m TIMES `combined salary`

§§ `6 תוספת השתלמות בית ספרית`

-- (א): from the salary of April 1994, 4% of the combined salary, "the
-- school in-service supplement"; (ב): from September 1994 it is 9.2%;
-- (ג): from the salary of May 1995, 11.2%. Each rate is the whole rate
-- from its month.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_c
GIVEN m IS A DATE @desc the salary month
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` m IS
    BRANCH
        IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) THEN 11.2%
        IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) THEN 9.2%
        IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1994) THEN 4%
        OTHERWISE 0

-- (ד): the percentage allowances are derived from the combined salary with
-- the §§5 and 6 supplements.
@ref akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN m IS A DATE, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of the percentage allowances under 1993` m `combined salary` IS
    `combined salary` TIMES (1 PLUS `the 1993 supplement rate on` m PLUS `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` m)

-- (ה): the 10% תוספת השהייה applies to the §§5–6 supplements and to the
-- other percentage supplements too.
@ref akn:art_6__para_e
`the 1993 stay supplement rate` MEANS 10%

GIVEN `the supplements of §§5–6 and the other percentage supplements` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 stay supplement on the percentage supplements` `the supplements of §§5–6 and the other percentage supplements` IS
    `the 1993 stay supplement rate` TIMES `the supplements of §§5–6 and the other percentage supplements`

-- (ו): the §§5–6 supplements are salary for every purpose and a component
-- of the determining salary, for pension and for severance.
@ref akn:art_6__para_f
DECLARE `what the 1993 supplements might count for` IS ONE OF
    `the determining salary, for 1993`
    `pension, for 1993`
    `severance pay, for 1993`
    `any other purpose, for 1993`

GIVEN p IS A `what the 1993 supplements might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the §§5–6 supplements of 1993 count for` p IF TRUE

§§ `7 תמורת עובדי ההוראה`

-- ¶1: what the teachers give for the school in-service supplement.
-- (א): a "unit" of 120 minutes of in-service training from 1.1.94, as
-- annexes ב'–ד' set out; (ב): the two working days before the school year
-- ("ימי ההערכות"), given from 1.8.94.
@ref akn:art_7 akn:art_7/p1 akn:art_7__para_a
`the 1993 in-service unit in minutes` MEANS 120

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 in-service unit is owed on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)

`the 1993 in-service unit` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `follow the 1993 in-service training at school`

@ref akn:art_7__para_b
`the 1993 preparation days` MEANS 2

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 preparation days are owed on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 1994)

`giving the 1993 preparation days` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `give the two preparation days of 1993`

-- (ג): the supplement is paid from April 1994, 11.2% in all, to those in
-- direct activity in formal-education institutions; not to complementary
-- education nor to teaching-scale employees in roles outside formal
-- education. One in a role parallel to the Ministry's supervision and
-- instruction is as a supervisor under §18.
@ref akn:art_7__para_c
DECLARE `1993 in-service role` IS ONE OF
    `direct activity in formal education, for 1993`
    `complementary education, for 1993`
    `a role outside formal education, for 1993`
    `a role parallel to supervision or instruction, for 1993`

GIVEN r IS A `1993 in-service role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid the 1993 in-service supplement as a teacher` r IF
    r EQUALS `direct activity in formal education, for 1993`

GIVEN r IS A `1993 in-service role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid the 1993 in-service supplement as a supervisor` r IF
    r EQUALS `a role parallel to supervision or instruction, for 1993`

#ASSERT `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) EQUALS 11.2%

§§ `8 בדיקת שחיקה עתידית`

-- (א)(1): the populations compared — engineers in grades 8 to 11+ of the
-- Ministry of Defence (the Ministry alone), the civil service and its
-- auxiliary units and the municipalities of Jerusalem, Haifa and
-- Beersheba; and teachers in the teaching scale in the grades of senior
-- teacher, B.A. or M.A., paid by the Ministry of Education, מל"מ מערכות,
-- ORT and those three municipalities; the note: municipal teachers to whom
-- this agreement does not wholly apply are left out. (א)(2): every taxable
-- pay component, fixed or varying monthly expense refunds included (a car,
-- say), save yearly refunds (car insurance, licence fees) and pay for
-- extra work actually done (overtime, stand-by, call-outs, duty rotas).
@ref akn:art_8 akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_2/p2
DECLARE `1993 erosion pay component` HAS
    `taxable, for the 1993 erosion check` IS A BOOLEAN
    `a yearly expense refund, for the 1993 erosion check` IS A BOOLEAN
    `pay for extra work done, for the 1993 erosion check` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN c IS A `1993 erosion pay component`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion check counts the component` c IF
        c's `taxable, for the 1993 erosion check`
    AND NOT c's `a yearly expense refund, for the 1993 erosion check`
    AND NOT c's `pay for extra work done, for the 1993 erosion check`

`the engineers' grades the 1993 erosion check compares` MEANS LIST "8", "9", "10", "11", "11+"
`the teachers' grades the 1993 erosion check compares` MEANS LIST "מורה בכיר", "B.A.", "M.A."

-- (א)(3)(א): the erosion is the rate of change between the teachers'
-- average monthly salary, computed on a yearly basis, and the engineers',
-- over the two years before and after the day of the check. (ב): the
-- example — the engineers' pay rising 15% and the teachers' 10% —
-- computes it as 1.15 / 1.10 − 1 and prints 4.5%. The formula gives
-- 4.545…%; the example prints it to one decimal, and the rule is not
-- rounded (convention rounding.default; asserted below).
@ref akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_a akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_b akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_b/p2 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3__cls_b/p3
GIVEN `the engineers' rise` IS A NUMBER, `the teachers' rise` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion rate` `the engineers' rise` `the teachers' rise` IS
    (1 PLUS `the engineers' rise`) DIVIDED BY (1 PLUS `the teachers' rise`) MINUS 1

#ASSERT (`the 1993 erosion rate` (15%) (10%)) `to the nearest` 0.001 EQUALS 4.5%

-- (ב)(1): every January the wages commissioner carries out the check; by
-- its rate the teachers are paid, or have set off from them, the "תוספת
-- שחיקה": paid where the teachers' pay was eroded, set off where it gained.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_1/p3
`the 1993 erosion check` MEANS
    PARTY `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`
    MUST  `carry out the 1993 erosion check`

`the month of the 1993 erosion check` MEANS 1

GIVEN `the erosion rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion supplement is paid` `the erosion rate` IF
    `the erosion rate` GREATER THAN 0

GIVEN `the erosion rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion supplement is set off` `the erosion rate` IF
    `the erosion rate` LESS THAN 0

-- (ב)(2): paid with the salary of February each year, at the latest with
-- that of April.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN `salary month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion supplement may be paid with the salary of month` `salary month` IF
    `salary month` AT LEAST 2 AND `salary month` AT MOST 4

`paying the 1993 erosion supplement` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay or set off the 1993 erosion supplement`

-- (ב)(3): notwithstanding the above, the first check is made in January
-- 1996, on the monthly average of the last 8 months of 1993 against the
-- monthly average of 1995's yearly salary in the same populations; ¶3:
-- the 11.2% of the in-service supplement is left out of 1995's average;
-- paid or set off in February 1996, at the latest in April 1996.
-- F-hh-1993-a: ¶3 then says "the first check procedure as set out in §3א
-- of this agreement" runs from January 1997, and (ב)(6) calls January 1997
-- "the first check": §3 has no (א), and January 1996 was just named the
-- first. Read under convention instruments.missing-clause: the reference
-- has no target and the rest applies as worded — the yearly check of
-- (ב)(1) runs from January 1997, and January 1996 is the initial check.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_3/p3
`the initial 1993 erosion check is made on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996
`the yearly 1993 erosion check runs from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1997
`the months of 1993 the initial check averages` MEANS 8
`the 1995 average leaves out the in-service supplement of` MEANS 11.2%

GIVEN `months of 1993 averaged` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `months of 1995 averaged` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the teachers' rise for the initial 1993 check` `months of 1993 averaged` `months of 1995 averaged` IS
    (sum `months of 1995 averaged` DIVIDED BY 12) DIVIDED BY (sum `months of 1993 averaged` DIVIDED BY `the months of 1993 the initial check averages`) MINUS 1

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 initial erosion difference may be paid on` d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 2 1996)
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 30 4 1996)

`the section §8(ב)(3) of 1993 names` MEANS "3א"
`the 1993 agreement's §3 has a subsection` MEANS FALSE

-- F-hh-1993-a's evidence: the reference names a subsection §3 does not
-- have, and the check it calls first comes a year after the first.
`§8(ב)(3) of 1993 names a §3א that does not exist and a second first check` MEANS
        NOT `the 1993 agreement's §3 has a subsection`
    AND `the section §8(ב)(3) of 1993 names` EQUALS "3א"
    AND DATE_SERIAL `the yearly 1993 erosion check runs from` GREATER THAN DATE_SERIAL `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on`
#ASSERT `§8(ב)(3) of 1993 names a §3א that does not exist and a second first check`

-- (ב)(4): where the check shows the engineers' extra work above 19% of
-- their total salary, the wages commissioner checks whether the change
-- came from pay for work done or from a wage supplement; a wage supplement
-- is counted in the check ("עולה על", strictly: convention thresholds.above).
@ref akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_4 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_4/p2
`the share of extra work that triggers the 1993 control check` MEANS 19%

GIVEN `the engineers' extra work as a share of their salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 control check is due` `the engineers' extra work as a share of their salary` IF
    `the engineers' extra work as a share of their salary` `is above` `the share of extra work that triggers the 1993 control check`

GIVEN `the change came from a wage supplement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion check counts the change` `the change came from a wage supplement` IF
    `the change came from a wage supplement`

-- (ב)(5): (א) a shared database for the check; (ב) the Treasury delivers
-- updated data on the populations every half year; (ג) its running cost is
-- shared equally between the parties.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_5 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_5__cls_a akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_5__cls_b akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_5__cls_c
`setting up the 1993 erosion database` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `set up the 1993 erosion database`

`the 1993 erosion data` MEANS
    PARTY `the Treasury`
    MUST  `deliver the half-yearly data to the 1993 erosion database`

`months between deliveries to the 1993 erosion database` MEANS 6
`each party's share of the 1993 erosion database's cost` MEANS 50%

-- (ב)(6): if after the first check (January 1997) a party finds that
-- significant changes call for a change of the method, it is changed by
-- agreement.
@ref akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_6 akn:art_8__para_b__subpara_6/p2
`changing the 1993 erosion check's method` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MAY   `agree a change in the 1993 erosion check's method`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 erosion method may be changed by agreement on` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the yearly 1993 erosion check runs from`

§§ `9 אקדמיזציה`

-- (א): in 5754 the in-service hour grants grow by 5,000 weekly hours and
-- 850 tuition refunds; (ב): a joint committee sets the criteria for
-- tuition refunds, travel and hour grants, and examines refunding the
-- registration fee; (ג): it may convert hour grants into tuition refunds
-- and back.
@ref akn:art_9 akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_c
`the weekly hours the 1993 agreement adds to the in-service grants in 5754` MEANS 5000
`the tuition refunds the 1993 agreement adds in 5754` MEANS 850

`setting the 1993 tuition criteria` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set the criteria for the 1993 tuition refunds and hour grants`

`converting the 1993 grants` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MAY   `convert in-service hour grants into tuition refunds, under 1993`

§§ `10 קרנות השתלמות (שבתון)`

-- (א): a team on the study funds — regulations, tax, contribution rates,
-- actuarial deficit and maternity leave.
@ref akn:art_10 akn:art_10__para_a
`examining the study funds under 1993` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine the study funds, under 1993`

-- (ב): from 5754 a teacher working above a full position may contribute to
-- the funds up to one and a half positions, the employer matching it; the
-- funds pay a sabbatical teacher the weighted average grant by their
-- regulations. "עד למשרה וחצי" is a ceiling the contribution reaches, so
-- it includes the one and a half (an exception to thresholds.until). (ג):
-- the arrangement needs the tax authorities' and the funds' approval, as
-- the teachers know.
@ref akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10__para_c
`the position the 1993 study-fund contributions reach` MEANS 1.5

GIVEN position IS A NUMBER, d IS A DATE, `approved by the tax authorities and the funds` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position a 1993 study-fund contribution is made on` position d `approved by the tax authorities and the funds` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) AND `approved by the tax authorities and the funds`
    THEN min position `the position the 1993 study-fund contributions reach`
    ELSE min position 1

`contributing above a full position under 1993` MEANS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `contribute to a study fund above a full position, under 1993`

§§ `11 מנהלים`

-- (א): a joint committee examines the principals' authority, post and pay,
-- by October 1993 at the latest; its recommendations go to the committee
-- of four — the wages commissioner, the Ministry's Director-General and
-- the heads of the two teachers' organisations.
@ref akn:art_11 akn:art_11__para_a
`examining the principals' pay under 1993` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine the principals' authority and pay, under 1993`

`the 1993 principals' committee reports by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 10 1993

-- (ב): the management allowance of a serving principal is derived from his
-- own salary; a serving principal keeps the right to it on the combined
-- salary of a certified teacher at the top of seniority or on his own,
-- whichever is higher; one taking the post in 5754 ("a new principal")
-- chooses between the two. (ג): one starting from 5755 on has it on his
-- own combined salary only, unless the committee of (א) decides otherwise.
@ref akn:art_11__para_b akn:art_11__para_c
DECLARE `1993 principal` HAS
    `took the post in the school year opening in` IS A NUMBER @desc the calendar year: 1993 for 5754
    `his own combined salary` IS A NUMBER
    `a certified teacher's combined salary at the top of seniority` IS A NUMBER
    `chose the top-seniority base, as a new principal of 5754` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN p IS A `1993 principal`, `the committee decided otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` p `the committee decided otherwise` IS
    BRANCH
        IF p's `took the post in the school year opening in` LESS THAN 1993
            THEN JUST (max (p's `his own combined salary`) (p's `a certified teacher's combined salary at the top of seniority`))
        IF p's `took the post in the school year opening in` EQUALS 1993
            THEN JUST (IF p's `chose the top-seniority base, as a new principal of 5754`
                       THEN p's `a certified teacher's combined salary at the top of seniority`
                       ELSE p's `his own combined salary`)
        IF `the committee decided otherwise`
            THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE JUST (p's `his own combined salary`)

`why a later principal's base is not here when the committee decided otherwise` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החלטת הוועדה המשותפת לבדיקת סמכויות המנהלים לפי סעיף 11(א) להסכם מיום 11.5.93"

§§ `12 גמולי השתלמות`

-- ¶1: the ceiling of the in-service allowance rises from 10 units to 12
-- in 5754, to 13 in 5755 and to 14 in 5756.
@ref akn:art_12 akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN `the year the school year opens in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 ceiling of in-service allowance units in` `the year the school year opens in` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the year the school year opens in` AT LEAST 1995 THEN 14
        IF `the year the school year opens in` EQUALS 1994 THEN 13
        IF `the year the school year opens in` EQUALS 1993 THEN 12
        OTHERWISE 10

-- ¶2–¶3: the double-degree allowance rises from 6.5 to 8.75 units from
-- 5754 (1.9.93).
@ref akn:art_12/p2 akn:art_12/p3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 double-degree allowance units on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) THEN 8.75 ELSE 6.5

-- ¶4, (א): the intermediate allowance rises from 3 to 4 units from 5754
-- (1.9.93).
@ref akn:art_12/p4 akn:art_12__para_a
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 intermediate allowance units on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) THEN 4 ELSE 3

-- (ב): it is given also to teachers holding a permanent teaching or
-- instruction licence who are not and were not entitled to the
-- double-degree allowance; 500 such allowances in 5754 and 500 more in
-- 5755; a joint committee sets the criteria; before the next agreement it
-- discusses a solution for the rest, within that agreement's cost.
@ref akn:art_12__para_b akn:art_12__para_b/p2 akn:art_12__para_b/p3 akn:art_12__para_b/p4
GIVEN `holds a permanent teaching or instruction licence` IS A BOOLEAN, `ever entitled to the double-degree allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may get the 1993 intermediate allowance by licence` `holds a permanent teaching or instruction licence` `ever entitled to the double-degree allowance` IF
    `holds a permanent teaching or instruction licence` AND NOT `ever entitled to the double-degree allowance`

GIVEN `granted in 5754` IS A NUMBER, `granted in 5755` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 1993 quota of intermediate allowances by licence` `granted in 5754` `granted in 5755` IF
    `granted in 5754` AT MOST 500 AND `granted in 5755` AT MOST 500

`setting the 1993 intermediate criteria` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set the criteria for the 1993 intermediate allowances`

§§ `13 רציפות ימי מחלה`

-- A teacher who moved from employer to employer without severance pay has
-- continuity of the compensation for unused sick days from the earlier
-- owners, by the takshir's criteria (outside the corpus); the State, the
-- Centre of Local Government and the three cities settle the arrangements
-- by the opening of the next school year (1.9.93); it applies to those
-- retiring from 5753 (August 1993) on.
@ref akn:art_13 akn:art_13/p1
GIVEN `moved between employers without severance` IS A BOOLEAN, `retired on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 sick-day continuity applies` `moved between employers without severance` `retired on` IF
    `moved between employers without severance` AND `retired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 1993)

`settling the 1993 sick-day continuity` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `settle the sick-day continuity arrangements of 1993`

`the 1993 sick-day arrangements are due by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993

`why the takshir's sick-day criteria are not in the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "תקנון שירות המדינה (תקשי\"ר), הקריטריונים לתשלום פיצוי בגין אי ניצול ימי מחלה"

§§ `14 שכר דירה (דרום)`

-- Teachers from the north teaching in the Bedouin localities in the south
-- get 200 a month toward rent, for a full position, from 1.9.93, if they
-- get no other rent participation; the sum is updated once a year by the
-- cost-of-living rate (set elsewhere). Paid pro rata to the position
-- (convention position.fixed-sum).
@ref akn:art_14 akn:art_14/p1
`the 1993 southern rent participation` MEANS 200

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `from the north, teaching in a Bedouin locality in the south` IS A BOOLEAN
      `gets another rent participation` IS A BOOLEAN
      position IS A NUMBER
      `the yearly cost-of-living updates since 1.9.93` IS A NUMBER @desc the product of one and each year's cost-of-living rate since 1.9.93
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 southern rent participation owed` d `from the north, teaching in a Bedouin locality in the south` `gets another rent participation` position `the yearly cost-of-living updates since 1.9.93` IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)
       AND `from the north, teaching in a Bedouin locality in the south`
       AND NOT `gets another rent participation`
    THEN `the 1993 southern rent participation` TIMES `the yearly cost-of-living updates since 1.9.93` TIMES position
    ELSE 0

`why the 1993 rent update is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "שיעור תוספת היוקר השנתית"

§§ `15 רכז השתלמות בביה"ס`

-- ¶1: one in-service coordinator for each school running the school
-- in-service programmes; ¶2: an allowance of 6%, like the subject
-- coordinator's arrangement, from 1.1.94 (on the base §6(ד) sets for the
-- percentage allowances: convention amounts.base).
@ref akn:art_15 akn:art_15/p1 akn:art_15/p2
`the 1993 in-service coordinators per school` MEANS 1
`the 1993 in-service coordinator's rate` MEANS 6%

GIVEN m IS A DATE, `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 in-service coordinator's allowance` m `combined salary` IS
    IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1994)
    THEN `the 1993 in-service coordinator's rate` TIMES `the base of the percentage allowances under 1993` m `combined salary`
    ELSE 0

`why the subject coordinator's arrangement of 1993 is not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הסדר גמול מרכז מקצוע שנהג ערב ההסכם מיום 11.5.93"

§§ `16 ועדה לתשלומים רטרואקטיביים ברשויות מקומיות`

@ref akn:art_16 akn:art_16/p1
`examining retroactive payments under 1993` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine retroactive payments in the local authorities, under 1993`

§§ `17 עו"ה־אם`

-- A mother-teacher (as the earlier agreements define her) who works above
-- 90% of a position, up to 140%, at the employer's demand, gets a
-- supplement of 10% from 1.9.93. "מעל ל־90%" is strict (convention
-- thresholds.above); "(עד 140%)" includes 140%, the most a teacher may be
-- employed (takanon §1.24.1.2(א)) — an exception to thresholds.until. The
-- 10% is a percentage allowance, on §6(ד)'s base (convention
-- amounts.base).
@ref akn:art_17 akn:art_17/p1
`the 1993 mother-teacher supplement rate` MEANS 10%
`the position above which the 1993 mother-teacher supplement is paid` MEANS 90%
`the position up to which the 1993 mother-teacher supplement is paid` MEANS 140%

GIVEN `a mother-teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, position IS A NUMBER, `at the employer's demand` IS A BOOLEAN, d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed the 1993 mother-teacher supplement` `a mother-teacher` position `at the employer's demand` d IF
        `a mother-teacher`
    AND `at the employer's demand`
    AND position `is above` `the position above which the 1993 mother-teacher supplement is paid`
    AND position AT MOST `the position up to which the 1993 mother-teacher supplement is paid`
    AND d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)

`why the mother-teacher's definition is not in the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "ההסכמים הקודמים בעניין עובדת הוראה אם (הסכם קיבוצי מיום 15.5.89)"

§§ `18 מפקחים זכאים לתוספת השתלמות בית ספרית (החל מ־1.4.94)`

-- (א): a parity committee chaired by a Treasury representative decides
-- which supervisors get the whole in-service supplement from 1.4.94; they
-- give up two days of their yearly leave, besides taking part in the
-- school in-service training. (ב): a supervisor not approved gets 2% only,
-- from 1.5.95.
@ref akn:art_18 akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_b
`deciding the 1993 supervisors` MEANS
    PARTY `the parity committee`
    MUST  `decide which supervisors get the 1993 in-service supplement`

`the leave days an approved supervisor gives up under 1993` MEANS 2

GIVEN `approved by the parity committee` IS A BOOLEAN, m IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a supervisor's 1993 in-service supplement rate on` `approved by the parity committee` m IS
    IF `approved by the parity committee`
    THEN (IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1994) THEN `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` m ELSE 0)
    ELSE (IF m `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) THEN 2% ELSE 0)

§§ `19 גמול ריכוז מקצוע במוסדות חינוך`

-- (א): in an institution with few classes, or in a subject at least two
-- teachers teach, and the hours of all its teachers are not below one
-- position, one of them is appointed coordinator and gets 4% of his
-- combined salary; 250 teachers in 5754 and no more than 500 in 5754 and
-- 5755 together. F-hh-1993-c: whether the hours condition governs the
-- small institution too, as it governs the subject, is not said; read as
-- governing both (convention reading.qualifier, as F-3.14-a reads the
-- takanon's copy of these words).
@ref akn:art_19 akn:art_19__para_a
DECLARE `1993 coordination case` HAS
    `an institution with few classes, for 1993` IS A BOOLEAN
    `teachers of the subject, for 1993` IS A NUMBER
    `positions all the subject's teachers hold, for 1993` IS A NUMBER

`the 1993 subject coordinator's rate` MEANS 4%

GIVEN c IS A `1993 coordination case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 1993 subject coordinator is appointed in` c IF
        (c's `an institution with few classes, for 1993` OR c's `teachers of the subject, for 1993` AT LEAST 2)
    AND c's `positions all the subject's teachers hold, for 1993` AT LEAST 1

-- The other reading: the hours condition governs the subject only.
GIVEN c IS A `1993 coordination case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 1993 subject coordinator is appointed, hours governing the subject only` c IF
        c's `an institution with few classes, for 1993`
    OR (c's `teachers of the subject, for 1993` AT LEAST 2 AND c's `positions all the subject's teachers hold, for 1993` AT LEAST 1)

-- The allowance is 4% "of his combined salary": the salary the
-- coordinator's allowance is paid on is his own combined salary.
GIVEN `his combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the salary §19(א) of 1993 pays a coordinator his allowance on` `his combined salary` IS
    `his combined salary`

GIVEN c IS A `1993 coordination case`, `his combined salary` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 subject coordinator's allowance` c `his combined salary` IS
    IF `a 1993 subject coordinator is appointed in` c
    THEN `the 1993 subject coordinator's rate` TIMES `the salary §19(א) of 1993 pays a coordinator his allowance on` `his combined salary`
    ELSE 0

GIVEN `approved in 5754` IS A NUMBER, `approved in 5755` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the 1993 quota of subject coordinators` `approved in 5754` `approved in 5755` IF
    `approved in 5754` AT MOST 250 AND `approved in 5754` PLUS `approved in 5755` AT MOST 500

`a small school with half a position in the subject, for 1993` MEANS
    `1993 coordination case` WITH
        `an institution with few classes, for 1993` IS TRUE
        `teachers of the subject, for 1993` IS 1
        `positions all the subject's teachers hold, for 1993` IS 0.5

-- F-hh-1993-c's evidence: the two readings part for a small institution
-- whose subject is taught at half a position.
`the two readings of §19(א) of 1993 differ for a small institution` MEANS
        NOT `a 1993 subject coordinator is appointed in` `a small school with half a position in the subject, for 1993`
    AND `a 1993 subject coordinator is appointed, hours governing the subject only` `a small school with half a position in the subject, for 1993`
#ASSERT `the two readings of §19(א) of 1993 differ for a small institution`

-- (ב): a joint committee sets the criteria for allocating the allowances
-- within the quota, regard being had to national-priority areas.
@ref akn:art_19__para_b
`setting the 1993 coordinator criteria` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set the criteria for the 1993 subject-coordinator allowances`

§§ `20 גמול להנחיית תלמיד בעבודת גמר`

-- (א): the Ministries of Education and Finance, consulting the teachers'
-- organisations, frame an alternative proposal to raise the allowance from
-- 1.9.93; (ב): within the tuition transfers to secondary education a
-- budget is paid for it.
@ref akn:art_20 akn:art_20__para_a akn:art_20__para_b
`proposing the 1993 thesis allowance` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `propose a larger thesis-guidance allowance, under 1993`

§§ `21 ביגוד לעו"ה בכיתות ז–ח ביסודי`

-- The clothing supplement of teachers of crafts and technology, art and
-- home economics in grades 7–8 of a primary school equals that of the
-- teachers of those subjects in a junior high school.
@ref akn:art_21 akn:art_21/p1
DECLARE `1993 clothing subject` IS ONE OF
    `crafts and technology, for 1993`
    `art, for 1993`
    `home economics, for 1993`
    `another subject, for 1993`

GIVEN s IS A `1993 clothing subject`, `teaches grades 7–8 in a primary school` IS A BOOLEAN, `the junior-high supplement for the subject` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 clothing supplement of a grade 7–8 teacher` s `teaches grades 7–8 in a primary school` `the junior-high supplement for the subject` IS
    IF `teaches grades 7–8 in a primary school` AND NOT (s EQUALS `another subject, for 1993`)
    THEN JUST `the junior-high supplement for the subject`
    ELSE NOTHING

§§ `22–24 ועדות`

-- §22: a special committee on the problems of the move to the new
-- budgeting method in the junior high schools; §23: a committee on the
-- structure of work and terms in primary education; §24: a joint committee
-- on the terms of teachers in the seminaries and colleges. Each finishes by
-- the end of 5754.
@ref akn:art_22 akn:art_22/p1 akn:art_23 akn:art_23/p1 akn:art_24 akn:art_24/p1
`the 1993 junior-high committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine the junior-high problems, under 1993`

`the 1993 primary committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine primary education, under 1993`

`the 1993 colleges committee` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `examine the seminaries' and colleges' terms, under 1993`

`the 1993 committees finish by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 1994

§§ `25 עו"ה מועבר מכיתות ז–ח לכיתות א–ו`

-- One who worked at least 10 years in a row in grades 7–8 and has to move
-- to grades 1–6 keeps the base of his position.
@ref akn:art_25 akn:art_25/p1
GIVEN `years in a row in grades 7–8` IS A NUMBER, `had to move to grades 1–6` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the grades 7–8 base under 1993` `years in a row in grades 7–8` `had to move to grades 1–6` IF
    `had to move to grades 1–6` AND `years in a row in grades 7–8` AT LEAST 10

§§ `26 גמלאים תקציביים`

-- The agreement is applied to budgetary pensioners, the teachers'
-- organisations undertaking to deduct 0.6% of the teachers' wage cost —
-- from the framework agreement of 1993 if one is signed, or from the first
-- erosion check's result, whichever comes first.
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26/p1
`the 1993 budgetary-pension share` MEANS 0.6%

GIVEN `the 1993 framework agreement signed on` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the 1993 budgetary-pension share is deducted on` `the 1993 framework agreement signed on` IS
    CONSIDER `the 1993 framework agreement signed on`
    WHEN JUST f THEN (IF DATE_SERIAL f LESS THAN DATE_SERIAL `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on` THEN f ELSE `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the initial 1993 erosion check is made on`

`deducting the 1993 budgetary-pension share` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    MUST  `deduct the 1993 budgetary-pension share`

§§ `27 החזר ימי שביתה`

-- No pay is deducted for the strike of April–May 1993; in return the
-- organisations add 10 school days to 5754, on dates the Ministry sets
-- with them by the end of July 1993.
@ref akn:art_27 akn:art_27/p1
`the 1993 strike days are deducted` MEANS FALSE
`the school days added to 5754` MEANS 10

`setting the added days of 5754` MEANS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `set the dates of the ten school days added in 5754`

`the added days of 5754 are set by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 7 1993

§§ `28 הסדר מסלולי הפרישה המוקדמת לעו"ה`

-- (א): the early-retirement tracks beside the accruing pension funds are
-- cancelled and moved to the Treasury, on the pattern of the additional
-- track of the wage agreements of 1988–1990, from 5754 (1.9.93). (The
-- clause goes from (א) to (ג): the page has no (ב).) (ג): in 5754 and 5755
-- the quotas are (1) 120 teachers on the early-retirement track, not fewer
-- than 100 from this agreement's period on; (2) 75 on the additional
-- track; (3) 25 in technological education (hurt by the reform). (ד): 220
-- teachers in all tracks in those two years. (ה): a joint committee
-- settles the rules and agreed changes this calls for.
@ref akn:art_28 akn:art_28__para_a akn:art_28__para_c akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_28__para_c__subpara_3 akn:art_28__para_d akn:art_28__para_e
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 early-retirement tracks are the Treasury's on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)

`the 1993 early-retirement quotas` MEANS LIST 120, 75, 25
`the 1993 early-retirement total` MEANS 220
`the 1993 early-retirement track's floor` MEANS 100

#ASSERT sum `the 1993 early-retirement quotas` EQUALS `the 1993 early-retirement total`

`settling the 1993 early-retirement rules` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `settle the rules of the 1993 early-retirement tracks`

`why the 1988–1990 wage agreements are not in the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הסכמי השכר לשנים 1988–1990 (המסלול הנוסף לפרישה מוקדמת)"

§§ `29 השתלמות בית ספרית`

-- Every teacher who takes part for two years in the school in-service
-- training gets one allowance unit; a joint committee sets how it is
-- carried out and checked.
@ref akn:art_29 akn:art_29/p1
GIVEN `years in the school in-service training` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1993 in-service allowance units earned` `years in the school in-service training` IS
    IF `years in the school in-service training` AT LEAST 2 THEN 1 ELSE 0

`setting the 1993 in-service unit's checks` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `set how the 1993 in-service unit is carried out and checked`

§§ `30 שעות נוספות`

-- ¶1: a joint team frames a proposal to pay overtime for a teacher's work
-- with pupils outside school beyond his regular hours, paid out of savings
-- or unused teaching hours or the substitutes' balance, within the
-- existing budget. ¶2: its recommendation, with the value of an overtime
-- hour and rules of operation, by 1.9.93. The agreement of 8.9.98, §4(י),
-- settles the union's claims under this section, and imports it.
@ref akn:art_30 akn:art_30/p1 akn:art_30/p2
`the 1993 out-of-school overtime proposal` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `propose overtime pay for work with pupils outside school, under 1993`

`the 1993 out-of-school overtime proposal is due by` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993
`the 1993 out-of-school overtime is paid within the existing budget` MEANS TRUE

§§ `31 גמולים אחוזיים`

-- A joint committee proposes changes to the percentage allowances, such as
-- the split allowance of a part-time mother-teacher and of grouping.
@ref akn:art_31 akn:art_31/p1
`proposing the 1993 percentage-allowance changes` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `propose changes to the percentage allowances, under 1993`

§§ `32 קובץ תנאי עבודה`

-- A joint committee compiles a book of the teachers' working conditions,
-- to serve as the basis of a labour code for the parties' teachers.
@ref akn:art_32 akn:art_32/p1
`compiling the 1993 book of working conditions` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MUST  `compile the book of teachers' working conditions, under 1993`

§§ `33 מיצוי תביעות הצדדים`

-- A full exhaustion of the parties' claims on wages, working conditions
-- and erosion, nationally and locally; no negotiation on them during its
-- period, nor on the economy's framework agreements.
@ref akn:art_33 akn:art_33/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `on wages, working conditions or erosion` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 1993 agreement exhausts the claim for` d `on wages, working conditions or erosion` IF
    `on wages, working conditions or erosion` AND `in the 1993 wage agreement's period` d

`no negotiation during the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `negotiate over wages and working conditions during the 1993 agreement`

§§ `34 שקט תעשייתי`

-- (א): every collective dispute declared on the matters settled here is
-- void on the signing.
@ref akn:art_34 akn:art_34__para_a
GIVEN `declared on` IS A DATE, `on a matter the 1993 agreement settled` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a labour dispute is void under the 1993 agreement` `declared on` `on a matter the 1993 agreement settled` IF
        `on a matter the 1993 agreement settled`
    AND `declared on` `is on or before` `the 1993 wage agreement was signed on`

-- (ב): during its period neither side, nor any of its units, strikes or
-- locks out, wholly or partly, or disrupts work, on the matters settled.
@ref akn:art_34__para_b
`industrial peace under the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 1993 agreement settled`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `strike or lock out over a matter the 1993 agreement settled`)

-- (ג): the employers undertake to give the teachers the supplement the
-- public-sector framework agreements of 1993–1995 give; if none is signed,
-- the value of the supplements the State's engineers' scale is given. Both
-- are outside the corpus. ¶2: in return the teachers do not negotiate
-- these supplements nor take organisational steps over them.
@ref akn:art_34__para_c
GIVEN `the framework supplements of 1993–1995` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc the supplement the public-sector framework agreements of 1993–1995 give, NOTHING if none was signed
      `the engineers' supplements of 1993–1995` IS A NUMBER @desc the value of the supplements given to the State's engineers' scale in those years
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement §34(ג) of 1993 gives` `the framework supplements of 1993–1995` `the engineers' supplements of 1993–1995` IS
    CONSIDER `the framework supplements of 1993–1995`
    WHEN JUST f THEN f
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the engineers' supplements of 1993–1995`

`why the 1993–1995 framework agreements are not in the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "הסכמי המסגרת במגזר הציבורי לשנים 1993–1995, וההסכמים על תוספות השכר לדירוג המהנדסים בשירות המדינה"

@ref akn:art_34__para_c/p2
`the teachers do not negotiate the 1993–1995 framework supplements` MEANS
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `negotiate the framework supplements of 1993–1995`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `take organisational steps over the framework supplements of 1993–1995`)

-- (ד): terms set earlier between the parties, not changed expressly or by
-- implication here, remain in force during its period.
@ref akn:art_34__para_d
`earlier terms stand unless the 1993 agreement changes them` MEANS TRUE

§§ `35 יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- ¶1: the joint committee — the wages commissioner, the Ministry's
-- Director-General, the Centre of Local Government's deputy director, the
-- chairmen of הסתדרות המורים and of ארגון המורים — follows the agreement
-- and decides disputes on its reading or application. ¶2: where it does
-- not decide, the parties may agree to put the matter to an arbitrator or
-- another mechanism.
@ref akn:art_35 akn:art_35/p1
`deciding disputes over the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    PARTY `the joint committee`
    MAY   `decide a dispute over the 1993 agreement`

@ref akn:art_35/p2
GIVEN `the joint committee decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 1993 dispute may go to an arbitrator` `the joint committee decided` IF
    NOT `the joint committee decided`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signing formula; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signatories: the Prime Minister, the Ministers of Finance and of Education, the wages commissioner, the Director-General, the Centre of Local Government, the three cities and the union's secretary-general; no rule.

§§ `נספחים`

-- akn:attachments The annexes' frame: a label row with no text of its own.

-- Annex א': the ministers' letter of 31.8.92. ¶1: the government sees in
-- education the main factor in shaping the next generation and invests in
-- it as in human capital; it will act to allot proper resources to
-- education and to the teacher's standing and terms. ¶2: they propose to
-- set up at once a joint committee to find ways to carry it out. ¶3: they
-- hope the teachers' organisations will cooperate.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1/p3
`the ministers' joint committee of 1992` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MAY   `set up the 1993 joint committee on the ministers' guidelines`

-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p4 A filing mark; no rule.

-- Annex ב': school in-service training in pre-primary and primary
-- education. (א) pre-primary: two components, each half the time —
-- (1) joint work of teams of 8–10 kindergarten teachers on (1.1) a unit of
-- content, (1.2) learning material for the class, (1.3) tools for
-- pedagogical initiatives, (1.4) tools for follow-up and evaluation;
-- (2) regional in-service courses for a supervision area on current
-- subjects; (3) subjects set by the supervisors with the teachers, each
-- teacher choosing among those offered in her area; (4) after the school
-- day or in the afternoon, as the place allows.
@ref akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1__cls_1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1__cls_1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1__cls_1-3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_1__cls_1-4 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_a__subpara_4
`the share of each pre-primary in-service component under 1993` MEANS 50%
`the smallest team of kindergarten teachers under 1993` MEANS 8
`the largest team of kindergarten teachers under 1993` MEANS 10

GIVEN `kindergarten teachers in the team` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a 1993 kindergarten in-service team` `kindergarten teachers in the team` IF
        `kindergarten teachers in the team` AT LEAST `the smallest team of kindergarten teachers under 1993`
    AND `kindergarten teachers in the team` AT MOST `the largest team of kindergarten teachers under 1993`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 A filing mark; no rule.

-- Annex ג': (ב) primary education: (1) in the whole staff (the
-- pedagogical council) and in teams, on (א) school curricula, (ב) fitting
-- curricula to the school, (ג) learning material for them; (2) in the
-- school or outside it, binding every teacher of the institution, visits
-- to demonstration schools included; (3) subjects set in the council or
-- with the teachers concerned; (4) none of it in the holidays.
@ref akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_1 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_1__cls_a akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_1__cls_b akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_1__cls_c akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_2 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_3 akn:att_3__hc_1__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN `in the holidays` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a primary in-service activity may be held under 1993` `in the holidays` IF
    NOT `in the holidays`

`every teacher of a primary institution is bound by its in-service training under 1993` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:att_3__hc_1/p1 A filing mark; no rule.

-- Annex ד': secondary and junior-high education. ¶1 the title. (1) in the
-- whole staff and smaller teams, on (א) the subjects taught, (ב) a unique
-- school curriculum, (ג) other subjects — heterogeneous classes,
-- technology, evaluation; (2) in the school or outside it, binding every
-- teacher with a pedagogical role (principals, subject teachers, class
-- educators, counsellors, grade and social-education coordinators, של"ח
-- guides and others); (3) in the school terms, beyond the teaching hours;
-- (4) a teacher in more than one school is bound in one, or in two at his
-- choice; (5) the plan, yearly or longer, is set by a competent school
-- body led by the principal and goes to the pedagogical council for
-- approval.
@ref akn:att_4__hc_1/p1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1__subpara_a akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1__subpara_b akn:att_4__hc_1__para_1__subpara_c akn:att_4__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_4__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN `beyond the teaching hours` IS A BOOLEAN, `in the school terms` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a secondary in-service activity may be held under 1993` `beyond the teaching hours` `in the school terms` IF
    `beyond the teaching hours` AND `in the school terms`

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_4
GIVEN `schools he teaches in` IS A NUMBER, `chose two` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the schools a 1993 secondary teacher trains in` `schools he teaches in` `chose two` IS
    IF `schools he teaches in` GREATER THAN 1 AND `chose two` THEN 2 ELSE min `schools he teaches in` 1

@ref akn:att_4__hc_1__para_5
`a school's 1993 in-service plan` MEANS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `plan the in-service training of a school`
    HENCE (PARTY `the school management`
           MAY   `approve a school's in-service plan`)

-- akn:att_4__hc_1/p2 A filing mark; no rule.

§§ `examples`

#ASSERT `the 1993 one-time payment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1992) 10000 EQUALS 2000
#ASSERT `the 1993 one-time payment` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1993) 10000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the share of the 1993 one-time payment for one who began on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 5 1993) EQUALS 1 DIVIDED BY 151
#ASSERT `the 1993 supplement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) 10000 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `the 1993 supplement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 1993) 10000 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1994) EQUALS 4%
#ASSERT `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1994) EQUALS 9.2%
#ASSERT `the 1993 school in-service supplement rate on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 1994) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the base of the percentage allowances under 1993` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) 10000 EQUALS 12120
#ASSERT `the 1993 erosion supplement is paid` (`the 1993 erosion rate` (15%) (10%))
#ASSERT `the 1993 erosion supplement is set off` (`the 1993 erosion rate` (10%) (15%))
#ASSERT `the 1993 control check is due` (20%)
#ASSERT NOT `the 1993 control check is due` (19%)
#ASSERT `the 1993 ceiling of in-service allowance units in` 1994 EQUALS 13
#ASSERT `the 1993 ceiling of in-service allowance units in` 2000 EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `owed the 1993 mother-teacher supplement` TRUE 1.4 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)
#ASSERT NOT `owed the 1993 mother-teacher supplement` TRUE 0.9 TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993)
#ASSERT `a supervisor's 1993 in-service supplement rate on` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) EQUALS 2%
#ASSERT `a supervisor's 1993 in-service supplement rate on` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 1995) EQUALS 11.2%
`two teachers of a subject at 1.2 positions, for 1993` MEANS
    `1993 coordination case` WITH
        `an institution with few classes, for 1993` IS FALSE
        `teachers of the subject, for 1993` IS 2
        `positions all the subject's teachers hold, for 1993` IS 1.2

#ASSERT `the 1993 subject coordinator's allowance` `two teachers of a subject at 1.2 positions, for 1993` 8000 EQUALS 320
#ASSERT `within the 1993 quota of subject coordinators` 250 250
#ASSERT NOT `within the 1993 quota of subject coordinators` 260 200
#ASSERT `the 1993 budgetary-pension share is deducted on` NOTHING EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1996
#ASSERT `the 1993 budgetary-pension share is deducted on` (JUST (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1994)) EQUALS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 1994
#ASSERT `the supplement §34(ג) of 1993 gives` NOTHING 0.05 EQUALS 0.05
#ASSERT `the position a 1993 study-fund contribution is made on` 1.6 (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1993) TRUE EQUALS 1.5
#ASSERT `the schools a 1993 secondary teacher trains in` 3 FALSE EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `keeps the grades 7–8 base under 1993` 10 TRUE
#ASSERT `a labour dispute is void under the 1993 agreement` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 4 1993) TRUE
#ASSERT `the 1993 agreement exhausts the claim for` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 1995) TRUE

`a principal of 5754 who chose the top base` MEANS
    `1993 principal` WITH
        `took the post in the school year opening in` IS 1993
        `his own combined salary` IS 8000
        `a certified teacher's combined salary at the top of seniority` IS 9000
        `chose the top-seniority base, as a new principal of 5754` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` `a principal of 5754 who chose the top base` FALSE EQUALS JUST 9000
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `1993 principal`
DECIDE `a principal on 8,000 who took the post in, for 1993` y IS
    `1993 principal` WITH
        `took the post in the school year opening in` IS y
        `his own combined salary` IS 8000
        `a certified teacher's combined salary at the top of seniority` IS 9000
        `chose the top-seniority base, as a new principal of 5754` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` (`a principal on 8,000 who took the post in, for 1993` 1990) FALSE EQUALS JUST 9000
#ASSERT `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` (`a principal on 8,000 who took the post in, for 1993` 1993) FALSE EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` (`a principal on 8,000 who took the post in, for 1993` 1995) FALSE EQUALS JUST 8000
#ASSERT `the salary the 1993 management allowance is derived from` (`a principal on 8,000 who took the post in, for 1993` 1995) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

`a teacher of a local authority, for the 1993 agreement` MEANS
    `1993 wage agreement teacher` WITH
        `in the teaching scale, for the 1993 agreement` IS TRUE
        `employed by one of the 1993 agreement's employers` IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the 1993 wage agreement applies to` `a teacher of a local authority, for the 1993 agreement`
